# Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
## Smart Agro-Supply Management System

## 1. Inventory Management KPIs

### 1.1 Stock Availability
| KPI | Formula | Target | Frequency |
|-----|---------|--------|-----------|
| Stock Availability Rate | (Items in Stock / Total Items) × 100 | > 95% | Daily |
| Stockout Frequency | Count of stockout events | < 2/month | Weekly |
| Stock Turnover Ratio | Cost of Goods Sold / Average Inventory | 4-6 | Monthly |

### 1.2 Inventory Efficiency
| KPI | Formula | Target | Frequency |
|-----|---------|--------|-----------|
| Inventory Accuracy | (Physical Count / System Count) × 100 | > 98% | Monthly |
| Carrying Cost Rate | (Carrying Costs / Average Inventory Value) × 100 | < 25% | Quarterly |
| Obsolete Stock Rate | (Obsolete Items / Total Items) × 100 | < 5% | Quarterly |

